-- Stage 3 Mathematics two-year program: 320 coming-soon placeholder lessons.
-- Year 5 and Year 6, 40 weeks each, 4 lessons a week (concept, strategies, problem solving, fluency and review).
-- Ten four-week units a year. Placeholders are shared lessons (family_id NULL) flagged coming_soon.
-- Build a lesson by replacing its row's data and removing coming_soon (keep the seed_key or add a topic suffix).
